      "value": "@{637283d99bf1a03c74a71501|full_name}: It totally does. I was just talking about this issue with someone this week. Currently my viewball is directly behind my eyes, so I expect the game to put my camera there. Where it _actually_ puts the camera is somewhere around the chin. I have been waiting a long time for a reasonable explanation of why the camera isn't simply positioned directly at the view ball and kept there.\n\nI can create a new ticket, but if the ticket is just going to be closed without fixing it - LIKE THIS ONE WAS - then what is the point, really?\n\nCreate me a place where I can file bug reports which stay open until the bug is actually fixed - then we can talk about me filing more tickets.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
