      "value": "@{5a4b034d1ab4366d42644996|full_name}: The settings I'm talking about are related to IK, you can find them in your QM settings.\n\n`Lock Hip` = locks your hip to your tracker point to prevent it from drifting, to compensate for that though the view point needs to drift.\n\n`Lock Head` = locks your head (view point) to your tracker point to prevent it from drifting, to compensate for that though the hips needs to drift.\n\n`Lock Both` = Locks both in place to prevent either from drifting.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
